  "_comment": "Tunable numbers. Every value is optional; see BalanceDef / DifficultyDef for defaults. Difficulty presets apply on top of the base numbers. Party XP: enemies give xpByTier[tier] (or their own 'xp'); levelXp[i] is the total XP for level i+1; each level, every living hero picks +levelUpHp max HP, a card upgrade or a card removal (never below minDeckSize). proficiencyLevels: +1 hero to-hit and spell DC at each listed party level. heroAttackBonus (per difficulty): added to every hero attack roll. fightLuck (per difficulty): Luck each fight starts with, spent before run Luck (startingLuck + events). damageLevels: +1 hero damage at each listed party level. grazeOnMiss: a missed attack (not a nat 1) still deals the hero's damage bonus. focusPerMiss: + to a hero's next attack per miss in a row. acCapByDepth: enemy AC in play is capped per Depth. rearmCards (per difficulty): cards a Rearm takes back from the discard. Round 11 (5 Depths): every per-Depth list has 5 entries. normalGroupByDepth = [min, max] normal group size; eliteAddsByDepth / bossAddsByDepth = extra normals (capped by an enemy's maxAdds); torchMultiplierByDepth = starting Torch \u00d7 critical path; layOnHandsBase/PerLevel = Paladin pool per fight. Round 12: regenTiresAfterRound = enemy regeneration and Hydra regrowth stop after this round (0 = never). enemyHpByDepth / enemyDamageByDepth = per-Depth enemy multipliers on top of everything else (shape the curve across Depths); a difficulty may add its own lists, multiplied on top.",
